:: Deadwood Coin Museum Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-coin-museum-link'>>
  <<deadwood-coin-context>>
  <<if !_coinReady or $combat or !_coinCave.found or !(_coinCave.coins gt 0 or _coinCave.museumCoins gt 0 or _coinCave.appraised)>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<antiqueicon 'cursed-coin'>><<lanLink `_coinCave.museumCoins gt 0 ? ['Ask to collect the loaned coins', '询问取回借展的金币'] : ['Ask about the island coins', '询问海岛金币的事']` 'Deadwood Coin Museum'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Coin Museum
<<location 'museum'>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<deadwood-coin-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Coin Museum'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _coinReady and !$combat and (_coinCave.coins gt 0 or _coinCave.museumCoins gt 0 or _coinCave.appraised)>>
  <<npc 'Winter'>><<person1>>
  <<if _coinCave.scene is 'collected'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Winter counts the coins into a pouch and hands it to you. "We have the casts and measurements. I hope you know what you are doing with the originals."' '温特把金币数进钱袋，交还给你，又在账册上划去借展记录。“翻模和记录都做好了。希望你知道该拿它们怎么办。”'>><br><br>
  <<elseif _coinCave.scene is 'loaned'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Winter places the coins in a lined tray and writes you a receipt. "A temporary loan. Come back whenever you need the originals."' '温特把金币放进垫着软布的托盘，给你开了张借据。“临时借展。需要原物时，随时来取。”'>><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Winter puts on a glove and examines the skull stamped on the coin. "Old work, but somebody melted down older pieces to make it. Where did you find this?"
        <br><br>
        You describe the cavern and stone chest. <<He>> takes a book from a shelf and turns to an account of a ship that carried similar coins. The sailors kept returning to the island, complaining of cold skin and missing heartbeats. The last entry says that every coin they took had to go back.
        <br><br>
        "A sailor's story," Winter says, glancing at your pale wrist. "But if you intend to follow it, you had better find all of them. Even those you gave away."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        温特戴上手套，仔细查看金币上的骷髅。“有些年头了，不过铸造时熔过更古老的钱币。你在哪儿找到的？”
        <br><br>
        你向<<him>>描述了洞窟与石箱。<<He>>从架上取下一本书，翻到一艘船的记载。书中的水手带走过相似的金币，后来却不断返回海岛，声称皮肤冰冷，心脏也不再跳动。最后一段提到，必须把取走的金币全数归还。
        <br><br>
        “水手们的传闻。”温特看了看你苍白的手腕。“但若你打算照着做，最好一枚也别漏。交给别人的，也得找回来。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if !_coinCave.appraised and _coinCave.coins gt 0>>
    <<icon 'coin-cave/coin-rubbing.png'>><<lanLink ['Let Winter record the markings (0:15)', '让温特记录纹饰 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Coin Museum'>>
      <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and $location is 'museum' and !_coinCave.appraised and _coinCave.coins gt 0>>
        <<set _coinCave.appraised to true, _coinCave.scene to ''>>
        <<money 10000>><<npcincr 'Winter' love 1>>
        <<pass 15>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>> · <<lanSwitch 'Research fee: ' '考察酬金：'>><<printmoney 10000>><<glove 'Winter'>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if _coinCave.appraised and _coinCave.coins gt 0 and !_coinCave.museumCoins>>
    <<antiqueicon 'cursed-coin'>><<lanLink ['Lend the coins for a display', '将携带的金币借给温特展览'] 'Deadwood Coin Museum'>>
      <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and $location is 'museum' and _coinCave.appraised and _coinCave.coins gt 0 and !_coinCave.museumCoins>>
        <<set _coinCave.museumCoins to _coinCave.coins, _coinCave.coins to 0, _coinCave.scene to 'loaned'>>
        <<if $museumAntiques.antiques.antiquecursedcoin is 'notFound'>>
          <<museumAntiqueStatus 'antiquecursedcoin' 'found'>><<museumAntiqueStatus 'antiquecursedcoin' 'talk'>>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if _coinCave.museumCoins gt 0>>
    <<antiqueicon 'cursed-coin'>><<lanLink ['Collect every loaned coin', '取回借展的全部金币'] 'Deadwood Coin Museum'>>
      <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and $location is 'museum' and _coinCave.museumCoins gt 0>>
        <<set _coinCave.coins += _coinCave.museumCoins, _coinCave.museumCoins to 0, _coinCave.scene to 'collected'>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the museum', '返回博物馆'] 'Museum'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Museum Cursed Gold Coin
<<npc 'Winter'>><<person1>>
<<lanSwitch 'Winter shows you a plaster cast and some rubbings in the case. "The records will do for the collection. You can collect the original coins whenever you need them."' '温特向你展示柜中的翻模和拓印。“这些足够留作馆藏记录。借展的金币，你需要时可以取走。”'>><br><br>
<<antiqueicon 'cursed-coin'>><<lanLink ['Discuss the original coins', '询问原物的事'] 'Deadwood Coin Museum'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return', '返回'] 'Museum'>><</lanLink>><br>
